# Flutter 项目结构

这是一个使用清洁架构模式的 Flutter 企业脚手架项目。

## Project Structure

```
lib/
├── app.dart                    # Main app configuration
├── main.dart                   # Entry point
├── core/                       # Core functionality
│   ├── constants/              # App constants and API endpoints
│   ├── di/                     # Dependency injection
│   ├── errors/                 # Error handling system
│   ├── l10n/                   # Localization
│   ├── network/                # Network layer (Dio client)
│   ├── router/                 # Navigation routing
│   ├── theme/                  # App theming
│   ├── utils/                  # Utility functions
│   └── widgets/                # Reusable widgets
├── features/                   # Feature modules
│   └── auth/                   # Authentication feature
│       ├── data/               # Data layer
│       │   ├── datasources/    # Remote and local data sources
│       │   ├── models/         # Data models
│       │   └── repositories/   # Repository implementations
│       ├── domain/             # Domain layer
│       │   ├── entities/       # Business entities
│       │   ├── repositories/   # Repository interfaces
│       │   └── usecases/       # Business logic use cases
│       └── presentation/       # Presentation layer
│           ├── pages/          # UI pages/screens
│           ├── widgets/        # Feature-specific widgets
│           └── providers/      # State management
└── shared/                     # Shared components
    ├── data/                   # Shared data layer
    ├── domain/                 # Shared domain layer
    └── presentation/           # Shared presentation layer
```

## Architecture Patterns

### Clean Architecture
- **Data Layer**: Data sources, models, repositories
- **Domain Layer**: Entities, repository interfaces, use cases
- **Presentation Layer**: Pages, widgets, state management

### Dependency Injection
- **File**: [di.dart](mdc:lib/core/di/di.dart)
- **Pattern**: Use GetIt for service locator pattern
- **Registration**: Register all dependencies in DI container

### State Management
- **Pattern**: Provider pattern for state management
- **Location**: `presentation/providers/` directories

### Error Handling
- **System**: Comprehensive error handling with StatusCode enum
- **Files**: [exceptions.dart](mdc:lib/core/errors/exceptions.dart), [failures.dart](mdc:lib/core/errors/failures.dart), [error_handler.dart](mdc:lib/core/errors/error_handler.dart)

## Key Files

- **Main Entry**: [main.dart](mdc:lib/main.dart)
- **App Config**: [app.dart](mdc:lib/app.dart)
- **API Endpoints**: [api_endpoints.dart](mdc:lib/core/constants/api_endpoints.dart)
- **Dio Client**: [dio_client.dart](mdc:lib/core/network/dio_client.dart)
- **Router**: [app_router.dart](mdc:lib/core/router/app_router.dart)
- **Theme**: [app_theme.dart](mdc:lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart)

## Development Guidelines

1. **Follow Clean Architecture** principles
2. **Use dependency injection** for all services
3. **Implement proper error handling** with StatusCode enum
4. **Write unit tests** for business logic
5. **Use consistent naming** conventions
6. **Document complex logic** with clear comments